# ==========================================================

# Unity generated folders
# Unity (any Unity project inside /game/**)
game/**/[Ll]ibrary/
game/**/[Tt]emp/
game/**/[Oo]bj/
game/**/[Bb]uild/
game/**/[Bb]uilds/
game/**/[Ll]ogs/
